{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イケメンの生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑個別握手会の時の服だよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前は京都にて全国握手会がありましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬ちゃんと同じだったんだぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんファンの皆様まあやと握手してくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでもらえたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しいまあや族の皆様\n会いに来てくれてありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも遠くから早い時間に来てくれて\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方やブログ名と顔が一致して嬉しかったり♪\nとっても楽しかったです♪\n楽しんでもらえたかな〜？\n楽しい二日間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方もいつもブログで応援してくれるからパワーが湧いてきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんは『どいやさん』についてめっちゃ語ってくれたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その１\nあのキャラクターは触ると低反発だそうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その２\nお風呂は必ず一番風呂に入るそうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば...\nメイクしてもらってたらメイクさんのメイク道具にどいやさんの絵が書いてあって...なぁちゃん絵上手いなぁって思いながらいつも見てるよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋ではワイワイして遊んだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんが光と鏡を使ってまあやの顔照してきたり(結構眩しい笑)、口にアミアミ、ちはるんの三人でラクガキしたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんが、今度また握手会一緒になりたいね♪って言ってくれたから嬉しかった〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでね、この前レッスン中まいやんとななみんにホッペにチューされた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の東京Zeppライブではトマトちゃんにチューされた......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブはみんなすごい沢山練習してつくりあげたから達成感半端ないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年の締めくくりだったし、会場も満員でギュウギュウで、今までのこと思い出すとなんか心がギュッとしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援聞こえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズ発表もあり、沢山乃木坂familyの方達と盛り上がれて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに素敵な１年にしてもらえて\n１年を大好きな人達といれて本当に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！♪\n京都の全国握手会の日、隣に座ってたかずみんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『個別握手での、まあやレーンの人はまあやblogみたいにキラキラしてる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってくれたんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と〜っても嬉しかったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや家さんを誉めてくれてテンション高山〜♪♪〜〜♪♪\n大好きかずみん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーPV 撮影の時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも何時に寝てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/27/1901247/0007.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}